<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 500s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 6th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 500s BCE, 362 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 69 were founded and 23 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Achaemenid Empire, the State of Chu and the State of Qin.</p></header>
